  {
   "id": "sugardew-island-your-cozy-farm-shop-289259@3858",
   "gameId": "sugardew-island-your-cozy-farm-shop-289259",
   "displayName": "Patch 3858",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-06-20T14:57:30.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello everyone!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Today we have the update to version 3812 for you. We use this to fix several reported errors and make some visual and adjustments. It's only thanks to your feedback that we're making such good progress. Thank you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🛠 ️ Adjustments and changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🔹We have adapted some texts to avoid confusion.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹UI elements have been adapted to improve accessibility.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹Your pets now lie on their pillows when you are in the house.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹If your pet follows you, it no longer happens that you talk to him if you actually want to inspect a plant or something similar.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹A few animations have been adjusted.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹While working precisely (penalties), it no longer happens that the game character does a moonwalk - it's actually a shame 😅.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹Missing sound effects have been added in some places - especially in the UI.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🐛 Bug fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🔹Fixed various display errors in UI elements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹Fixed a bug that teleported the player to other locations in some situations.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹It can no longer happen that you accidentally sit on a bench with an NPC in front of it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹Fixed a bug on Steamdeck that made a headgear in Character Designer invisible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹Some general bugs have also been fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope you continue to have fun with Sugardew Island. If so, we would be very happy to receive a review on Steam! Your reviews not only help us, but also other players who are interested in the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "💬 As always: If you discover any further errors or have any wishes, let us know – it's our turn!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🌿✨Your team rokaplay 🌿🏡",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
