  {
   "id": "sugardew-island-your-cozy-farm-shop-289259@3812",
   "gameId": "sugardew-island-your-cozy-farm-shop-289259",
   "displayName": "Patch 3812",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-04-03T14:43:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hey everyone!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "With the new update v3812, we’ve fixed several reported issues and implemented some important quality-of-life improvements. Thank you so much for your feedback and continued support!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "✨ New & Noteworthy",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "✅ Keybindings for Mouse & Keyboard – You can now customize your controls to suit your playstyle!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🐛 Bug Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🔹 Cutscene fix at the Harmony Tree – Resolved a rare bug that could block progress after certain cutscenes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹 Tool loss hotfix – In very rare cases, tools could disappear. Affected players can now restore their tools at the workbench.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹 Inventory expansion fix – Bag upgrades were sometimes lost after saving and reloading. This issue has now been resolved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹 Crash when returning to the main menu – A crash that could occur when exiting to the main menu has been fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹 Skill max level bug – Fixed an issue that occurred when leveling a skill to its maximum.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you're enjoying the update and having fun with Sugardew Island, it would mean a lot to us if you left a review on Steam. Your feedback not only helps us but also supports new players in discovering the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "💬 As always: If you find any other bugs or have suggestions, let us know – we're on it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for your support & enjoy your time on Sugardew Island! 🌿✨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your rokaplay team 🌿🏡",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "[table noborder=1]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
