  {
   "id": "sugardew-island-your-cozy-farm-shop-289259@3782",
   "gameId": "sugardew-island-your-cozy-farm-shop-289259",
   "displayName": "Patch 3782",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-03-12T09:48:45.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hey everyone!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "It’s been only five days since Sugardew Island launched on March 7, and we’ve already been hard at work making improvements. We are closely listening to your feedback and implementing changes step by step – thank you for your patience and support!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First things first: Keybinding is in progress! 🎮 Many of you have asked for it – we are actively working on it and hope to have it ready soon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "✨ Key Improvements & Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "✅ Achievements from the demo are now automatically unlocked when loading your save in the full version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🏆 Fixed a bug that prevented the last Steam achievement from being obtained.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "🛒 Shop balancing update – We’ve made several adjustments to improve the overall experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "💎 Dewdrop bonus after selling items – You now receive a bonus when leaving the shop, based on your shopkeeping level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "⚡ Energy warning improved – It now appears earlier but is no longer persistent.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎵 Many new and adjusted sounds for better atmosphere.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "📌 Fixed a UI issue in the shop that could occur when entering with low energy before seeing Tomte’s introduction.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎮 More controller support – Long sales lists on the stats screen can now be scrolled using a controller.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "💬 Speech bubble system fully reworked – They now behave as intended.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🌧️ Rain and other visual effects improved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "📝 Fixed missing text & translation errors.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔄 Fixed various bugs that could cause softlocks in cutscenes or character interactions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🐾 Fixed an issue where animal companions were displayed as incorrect pets.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "💰 Fixed a bug that allowed purchases at the workbench without having enough dewdrops.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Your feedback matters to us! 💛",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We know that many players still have additional requests for improvements, and we hear you! This update is just the beginning – we will continue implementing your feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "One of the most requested features is Keybinding, and we’re working hard to bring it to the game as soon as possible. Please bear with us – it’s coming soon!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "If you’re enjoying the update and having fun with Sugardew Island, it would mean a lot to us if you could leave a review on Steam. Your feedback not only helps us but also assists other players who are considering the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "💬 Let us know what you think! And if you encounter any bugs, please report them – we’ll make sure to fix them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for your support & enjoy your time on Sugardew Island! 🌿✨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your rokaplay team 🌿🏡",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[table noborder=1]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
