  {
   "id": "sugardew-island-your-cozy-farm-shop-289259@major-2025-02-07",
   "gameId": "sugardew-island-your-cozy-farm-shop-289259",
   "displayName": "Sugardew Island – Update & Thank You!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-07T19:33:39.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hey everyone!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We want to express our heartfelt thanks for all your incredible feedback, it’s truly amazing to see so many of you actively participating! 🎉The first Kickstarter backers have now gained access to the full version, and your feedback has been invaluable in helping us improve the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Our Plan for the Coming Weeks",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We're working hard on your bug reports and planning to release updates every Friday (subject to change) for beta users. Only one month until release – we're giving it our all! 🚀",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Today's Fixes & Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "✅ Shop tables: Inventory bag was broken",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Item placement (B): Canceling now works correctly for bag, chest, and table",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ CountPanel: Darker background for better readability",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ CountPanel: X-Button now properly in the background",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ RB/LB: Better positioning & improved visibility",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Controller & mouse input: Fix for “Feed All” input prompt",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Upgrades: Now properly unlock when loading a savegame",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Controller navigation: Now works without needing to press a button first",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Mailbox popup: No longer opens at incorrect moments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Missing description text for dead plants added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Corrected term for \"Place\" in inventory",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Renamed “Reward” → “Unlocks”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Multiple seeds per day from animals? (Still under testing)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Various text improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Handbook bug with controller input fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Some sound issues fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "❓ Intro videos on Steam Deck: Fix implemented, but not yet tested 😉",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "And that’s just part of the improvements – we’ve fixed even more!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ll continue working on Monday, and we’re absolutely loving all your feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you so much for your support – you’re amazing! 💖",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Team rokaplay",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "[table noborder=1]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
